@startuml
title Visitor Pattern - Inspection Process

actor User
participant Demo
participant Directory
participant ProjectVisitor
participant SecurityAuditVisitor
participant SourceCodeFile

User -> Demo: main()
Demo -> Directory: sampleProject()
Demo -> SecurityAuditVisitor: create visitor
Demo -> Directory: accept(visitor)
Directory -> SourceCodeFile: accept(visitor)
SourceCodeFile -> SecurityAuditVisitor: visit(this)
SecurityAuditVisitor --> SourceCodeFile: inspection result
Directory --> Demo: inspection completed
Demo --> User: display security report

@enduml